75	/// Environment-activated completions for your CLI
76	///
77	/// Benefits over a CLI completion argument or subcommand
78	/// - Performance: we don't need to generate [`clap::Command`] twice or parse arguments
79	/// - Flexibility: there is no concern over it interfering with other CLI logic
